Short ur-initial fragments get the largest response, especially after i/y.
The same spelling split across tokens also counts; a weaker response persists
on a word-fragment following ur. Common whole words respond less. Medical
ur- roots and URL spellings have separate strengths. Transliteration covers
related spellings in other scripts, but excludes Han characters.
